  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ink&#xF6;p, leverans och installation av en telekommunikationsradiol&#xE4;nk f&#xF6;rSanski Most - Prijedor. Part &#xE4;r IMG. 120 linjer f&#xF6;r kommunikation mellan st&#xE4;derna och 360 linjer tillg&#xE4;ngliga f&#xF6;r &#xF6;vrig interentitets- trafik. Projektet ber&#xE4;knas vara avslutat senast augusti 1998.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement, delivery and installation of a radiolink (telecom) between Sanski Most and Prijedor. Implementing partner is IMG. 120 lines are available for communications between Sanski Most and Prijedor, 360 lines for other interentity communications. Project willbe completed latest August 1998.</narrative>
